    "process_md": "&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; **Registration**\n\n**Step-1 :** Applicant have to visit the [official website](https://online.bih.nic.in/) and click on &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;[Apply online](https://online.bih.nic.in/swf/swftc/)&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;\n**Step-2 :** Click on &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;[Click here to register](https://online.bih.nic.in/swf/swftc/Register.aspx)&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;.\n**Step-3 :** Fill out the required details and click on Register**.**\n**Step-4 :**  Note down the user-id and password. \n&amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\n\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; **Online Application**\n\n**Step-1 :** Applicant have to visit the [official website](https://online.bih.nic.in/) and click on &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;[Apply online](https://online.bih.nic.in/swf/swftc/)&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;\n**Step-2 :** Click on &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;[Login](https://online.bih.nic.in/SWF/SWFTC/Login.aspx)&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot; using the noted user-id and password.\n**Step-3 :** Fill out the required details:\n\n\n    - Personal Details\n    - Upload : Photo, Signature and Certificate Details \n    - Validate  Email ID\n    - Documents: Birth Certificate, Physically Handicapped Certificate, Residential Certificate, Income Certificate, Identity Card (College / University Campus / Place of Employment).\n\n\n    - Finalize and submit application.\n\n\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\n\n"
