   "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n1. The applicant should be a locomotor-disabled student/employee.  \n1. The applicant should be a permanent resident of Bihar.\n1. The applicant&#39;s annual family income should not exceed ₹2,00,000/-.\n1. The applicant&#39;s age should be 18 years or above. \n1. The applicant&#39;s minimum disability should be 60 percent. \n1. The student or employee must reside at least distance of 3 kilometers or more from their respective place of education or work.\n\n"
  },
  "schemeContent": {
